---
// Toy 2-D "embeddings" for three headlines, with cosine similarity computed in Python:
// cos(A,B)=0.894 (26.6 deg), cos(A,C)=0.000 (90 deg), cos(B,C)=0.447 (63.4 deg).
// Alpha 6.8 (51Labs project) links clusters above cosine 0.82 (34.9 deg) and drops a duplicate theme above 0.88 (28.4 deg).
const W = 900;
const H = 360;
const OX = 150;
const OY = 300;
const S = 70;
const vec = [
  { id: 'A', x: 3, y: 1, en: 'A: Bank profit rises', vi: 'A: Lợi nhuận ngân hàng tăng', cls: 'a' },
  { id: 'B', x: 2, y: 2, en: 'B: Lender earnings climb', vi: 'B: Thu nhập nhà cho vay tăng', cls: 'b' },
  { id: 'C', x: -1, y: 3, en: 'C: Steelmaker probe opens', vi: 'C: Thanh tra nhà sản xuất thép', cls: 'c' },
];
const ex = (v: { x: number; y: number }) => OX + v.x * S;
const ey = (v: { x: number; y: number }) => OY - v.y * S;
const rows = [
  { p: 'A–B', c: '0.894', deg: '26.6°', en: 'same story', vi: 'cùng chuyện' },
  { p: 'B–C', c: '0.447', deg: '63.4°', en: 'weakly related', vi: 'liên quan yếu' },
  { p: 'A–C', c: '0.000', deg: '90.0°', en: 'unrelated', vi: 'không liên quan' },
];
---
<figure class="p17e">
  <div class="p17e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three headlines drawn as arrows from one point. Bank profit rises and Lender earnings climb point in nearly the same direction, with an angle of 26.6 degrees and cosine similarity 0.894. Steelmaker probe opens points in another direction: cosine 0.447 with Lender earnings, and 0.000 with Bank profit. A side table lists the three values, and notes that a 51Labs project links clusters above 0.82, which is 34.9 degrees.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="p17e-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Meaning as direction: cosine similarity of three headlines</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nghĩa là hướng: cosine similarity của ba tiêu đề</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1={OX - 100} y1={OY} x2={OX + 260} y2={OY} class="p17e-axis" />
    <line x1={OX} y1={OY + 6} x2={OX} y2="60" class="p17e-axis" />
    {vec.map((v) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={OX} y1={OY} x2={ex(v)} y2={ey(v)} class={`p17e-vec is-${v.cls}`} />
        <circle cx={ex(v)} cy={ey(v)} r="5" class={`p17e-pt is-${v.cls}`} />
        <text x={ex(v) + 10} y={ey(v) + 4} class="p17e-lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{v.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{v.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={OX + 84} y={OY - 8} class="p17e-s"><tspan data-lang-en>26.6°</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>26,6°</tspan></text>

    <rect x="560" y="56" width="320" height="210" rx="8" class="p17e-panel" />
    <text x="576" y="82" class="p17e-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>cos = (a · b) / (|a| |b|)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cos = (a · b) / (|a| |b|)</tspan>
    </text>
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="576" y={114 + i * 30} class="p17e-num">{r.p}</text>
        <text x="628" y={114 + i * 30} class="p17e-num"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.c}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.c.replace(".", ",")}</tspan></text>
        <text x="690" y={114 + i * 30} class="p17e-s"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.deg}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.deg.replace(".", ",")}</tspan></text>
        <text x="748" y={114 + i * 30} class="p17e-s">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="576" y1="214" x2="864" y2="214" class="p17e-rule" />
    <text x="576" y="238" class="p17e-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A 51Labs project links themes above 0.82 (34.9°)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dự án 51Labs nối chủ đề khi trên 0,82 (34,9°)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="576" y="256" class="p17e-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>and drops a duplicate above 0.88 (28.4°).</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>và loại bản trùng khi trên 0,88 (28,4°).</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="344" class="p17e-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Real embeddings have hundreds of dimensions; the arithmetic is the same.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Embedding thật có hàng trăm chiều; phép tính y hệt.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say each headline is turned into a two-number vector. Cosine is the angle between the arrows: 1 means the same direction, 0 means nothing in common.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử mỗi tiêu đề được đổi thành một vector hai số. Cosine là góc giữa các mũi tên: 1 là cùng hướng, 0 là không có gì chung.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p17e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p17e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p17e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p17e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p17e .p17e-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17e .p17e-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17e .p17e-lab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17e .p17e-num { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p17e .p17e-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17e .p17e-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p17e-axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p17e-vec { stroke-width: 2.4; }
  .p17e-vec.is-a, .p17e-pt.is-a { stroke: var(--gold-icon); fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p17e-vec.is-b, .p17e-pt.is-b { stroke: var(--text); fill: var(--text); }
  .p17e-vec.is-c, .p17e-pt.is-c { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red); }
  .p17e-arc { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p17e-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p17e-rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p17e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
